  "question": {
    "text": "A circuit is connected as shown in the figure with the switch $S$ open. When the switch is closed, the total amount of charge that flows from $Y$ to $X$ is\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0016_556551548d52.png\"><br>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\nzero\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$54 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$27 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$81 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "From $Y$ to $X$ charge flows to plates $a$ and $b$.\n$$\n\\left(q_0+q_b\\right)_i=0,\\left(q_0+q_b\\right)_f=27 \\mu \\mathrm{C}\n$$\n<img src=\"assets\\st0016_33251650e822.png\"><br><img src=\"assets\\st0016_8045b8718baa.png\"><br>\n$\\therefore 27 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ charge flows from $Y$ to $X$.\n$\\therefore$ Correct option is (c)"
  }
}